msgstr "只有可见性允许的 Agent,其目录条目才会发布给对等方。节点通过 ``anet visibility`` 设置:"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:137
msgid ""
"The values are ``hub-local``, ``federated`` and ``public``; nodes that "
"stay at ``hub-local`` are never published to a peer."
msgstr ""
"取值为 ``hub-local``\\ 、\\ ``federated`` 和 ``public``;保持为 ``hub-local`` "
"的节点从不会发布给对等方。"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:142
msgid "Routes"
msgstr "路由"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:144
msgid ""
"All routes below are served under ``/fed/v3/``. They answer only requests"
" signed by a hub in the peer table, and every successful call returns "
"status 200. Any other path under ``/fed/v3/`` answers ``404 not_found``."
msgstr ""
"下列所有路由均位于 ``/fed/v3/`` 之下。它们只应答由对等方表中的 hub 签名的请求,每次成功的调用均返回状态 200。\\ "
"``/fed/v3/`` 下的其他任何路径返回 ``404 not_found``\\ 。"

