msgstr "用途"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:154
msgid "``POST /fed/v3/forward``"
msgstr "``POST /fed/v3/forward``"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:155
msgid ""
"Deliver a sealed envelope to a recipient registered at this hub. One hop;"
" the receiver does not forward it again."
msgstr "将封闭信封投递给注册在本 hub 的收件方。仅一跳;接收方不再转发。"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:157
msgid "``POST /fed/v3/directory:bucket``"
msgstr "``POST /fed/v3/directory:bucket``"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:158
