msgstr "应答对等方对信封状态的查询,这些信封是本 hub 为对方的发送方排入队列的(送达确认)。"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:163
msgid "``GET /fed/v3/cards``"
msgstr "``GET /fed/v3/cards``"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:164
msgid ""
"The stream of A2A Agent Cards, and withdrawals of cards, of agents "
