msgstr "注册在本 hub、且已选择公开的 Agent 的 A2A Agent 卡片流及卡片撤回流。"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:166
msgid "``GET /fed/v3/reviews``"
msgstr "``GET /fed/v3/reviews``"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:167
msgid "The stream of signed reviews of this hub's agents."
msgstr "对本 hub 上 Agent 的已签名评价流。"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:168
msgid "``POST /fed/v3/settle``"
msgstr "``POST /fed/v3/settle``"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:169
msgid ""
"Settle a payment on this hub's ledger on behalf of a peer's merchant (see"
" :ref:`ops-facilitator`)."
msgstr "代表对等方的商家,在本 hub 的账本上结算一笔付款(参见 :ref:`ops-facilitator`)。"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:171
msgid "``POST /fed/v3/clear``"
msgstr "``POST /fed/v3/clear``"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:172
msgid "Record a discharge of what the calling hub owes this one."
msgstr "记录调用方 hub 对本 hub 所欠债务的清偿。"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:174
msgid ""
"The reverse proxy must pass ``/fed/v3/`` unchanged. The routes bound the "
"size of the request body, and the hub rejects a request whose signing "
"time is stale or whose signature has been seen before."
msgstr "反向代理必须原样透传 ``/fed/v3/``\\ 。这些路由限制请求体的大小;hub 会拒绝签名时间已过期,或签名曾经出现过的请求。"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:178
msgid ""
"Refusals use the same JSON body as the rest of the hub, with a ``reason``"
