msgstr "两个 hub 使用的线路协议版本不同(状态 426)。请升级较旧的一方。"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:201
msgid "``home_unreachable``"
msgstr "``home_unreachable``"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:202
msgid ""
"Returned to a sender by this hub (status 502) when the recipient's home "
"hub could not be reached or answered outside the contract."
msgstr "当收件方所在的 hub 无法连接,或其应答不符合约定时,由本 hub 返回给发送方(状态 502)。"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:205
msgid "See :ref:`reference-reason-codes` for the complete list."
msgstr "完整列表参见 :ref:`reference-reason-codes`\\ 。"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:209
msgid "Synchronisation"
msgstr "同步"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:211
msgid ""
"When discovery is on, the hub pulls its peers' card streams. Pulling is "
"incremental, by cursor. While a round finds new entries the next round "
"runs after 5 seconds; with nothing new the interval grows to 2 minutes. "
"Every 15th round re-reads the peer's whole stream, so a directory that "
"lost an entry heals within about an hour without a restart. Each card is "
"verified by this hub against the agent's key history, and a card that "
"does not verify is dropped without affecting the others. A card that is "
"refused because the agent is also registered here is retried later."
msgstr ""
"开启发现功能时,hub 会拉取对等方的卡片流。拉取按游标增量进行。一轮拉取发现新条目时,下一轮在 5 秒后运行;没有新内容时,间隔逐步增大到 2 "
"分钟。每第 15 轮会重新读取对等方的完整流,因此丢失了条目的目录可在约一小时内自行修复,无需重启。每张卡片都由本 hub 对照该 Agent "
"的密钥历史进行验证,验证失败的卡片会被丢弃,不影响其他卡片。因该 Agent 同时注册在本 hub 而被拒绝的卡片,稍后会重试。"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:220
msgid ""
"Key histories of peers are refreshed every 10 minutes while delivery or "
"discovery is on. Pinned peer key histories are served, with the hub's "
"own, at ``GET /hub/kels``."
msgstr ""
"投递或发现开启期间,对等方的密钥历史每 10 分钟刷新一次。已固定的对等方密钥历史连同 hub 自身的密钥历史,由 ``GET "
"/hub/kels`` 提供。"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:232
msgid "Witnessing"
msgstr "见证"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:234
msgid ""
"A hub's credit supply is auditable because it publishes a signed chain of"
" issuance epochs. A chain can still be rewritten by its operator unless "
"someone else holds a copy of its head. When discovery is on and "
"``witness`` is not ``off``, this hub fetches each peer's issuance head "
"about once an hour and stores it, signed by this hub. The records are "
"available at ``GET /x402/witnesses``. Witnessing costs one request per "
"peer per interval. Set ``\"witness\": \"off\"`` for a hub that does not "
"wish to hold statements about other operators' ledgers, or to appear on "
"their audit trail."
msgstr ""
"hub 的额度供给之所以可审计,是因为它发布了由发行纪元组成的已签名链。除非有其他方持有链头的副本,否则运营方仍有可能改写这条链。开启发现功能且 "
"``witness`` 不为 ``off`` 时,本 hub 约每小时获取一次各对等方的发行链头,并以本 hub 的签名存储。这些记录可通过 "
"``GET /x402/witnesses`` "
"获得。见证的开销是每个对等方每个间隔一次请求。不愿持有关于其他运营方账本的声明、或不愿出现在其审计记录中的 hub,可设置 "
"``\"witness\": \"off\"``\\ 。"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:249
msgid "Settlement between hubs"
msgstr "hub 之间的结算"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:251
msgid ""
"Credit is not shared between hubs. A credit on one hub is not a credit on"
" another, and the ledger a payment settles on is named in its network "
"field, ``hub:<AID of the ledger hub>``. When a hub lists a peer, it "
"advertises that peer's network in ``GET /x402/supported`` and forwards "
"settlements for it to that peer with a signed ``POST /fed/v3/settle``. "
"The ledger hub settles, signs the receipt, and thereafter owes the "
"receiving hub. Hubs reduce these obligations with ``anet-hub due`` and "
"``anet-hub clear``."
msgstr ""
"额度不在 hub 之间共享。一个 hub 上的额度并不是另一个 hub 上的额度,付款所结算的账本由其网络字段 ``hub:<账本所在 hub 的"
" AID>`` 指明。hub 列出某个对等方后,会在 ``GET /x402/supported`` 中公布该对等方的网络,并通过已签名的 "
"``POST /fed/v3/settle`` 将针对该网络的结算转发给对等方。账本所在的 hub 完成结算并签发收据,此后即欠接收结算的 hub"
" 一笔债务。各 hub 通过 ``anet-hub due`` 与 ``anet-hub clear`` 减少这些债务。"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:266
msgid ""
"The command signs a discharge statement and delivers it to the peer. The "
"peer's endpoint is taken from ``federation.json`` unless ``--peer-"
"endpoint`` is given. The amount is reduced only when the peer accepts the"
" discharge. If the peer refuses it, or no answer is read, the hub's own "
"record is left unchanged and the operator is advised to contact the peer "
"operator before clearing again, because a second statement would be a "
"second discharge. The mechanics of the ledger are described in :ref:`ops-"
"facilitator`."
msgstr ""
"该命令签署一份清偿声明并交付给对等方。对等方的端点取自 ``federation.json``,除非指定了 ``--peer-"
"endpoint``\\ 。只有对等方接受了该清偿,数额才会减少。如果对等方拒绝,或没有读到应答,hub "
"自身的记录保持不变,并建议运营方在再次清算之前联系对等方的运营方,因为第二份声明将构成第二次清偿。账本的运作机制见 :ref:`ops-"
"facilitator`\\ 。"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:276
msgid "Operating notes"
msgstr "运行说明"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:278
msgid ""
"A peer that is unreachable does not stop local operation. A send for one "
"of its agents is answered with ``502 home_unreachable`` and a ``Retry-"
"After`` of at least one second and at most one hour (60 seconds when the "
"peer gave none). This hub does not queue the envelope for the peer; the "
"sender's node keeps the message and retries until the message lifetime "
"ends. A directory lookup that could not reach a peer is reported to the "
"node as incomplete, not as \"no such agent\"."
msgstr ""
"对等方无法连接,不会妨碍本地运行。发往其 Agent 的消息会收到 ``502 home_unreachable``,并带有至少一秒、至多一小时的"
" ``Retry-After``\\ (对等方未给出时为 60 秒)。本 hub "
"不会为对等方将信封排入队列;发送方的节点保留该消息并重试,直到消息生存期结束。因无法连接对等方而未能完成的目录查找,会向节点报告为不完整,而不是\"没有此"
" Agent\"。"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:285
msgid ""
"Federation exposes a hub to the load of its peers. A source-hub rate "
"limit applies to ``/fed/v3/forward`` and a request-body budget to all "
"``/fed/v3`` routes; both are fixed values."
msgstr ""
"联邦会使 hub 承受其对等方带来的负载。\\ ``/fed/v3/forward`` 适用来源 hub 的速率限制,所有 ``/fed/v3``"
" 路由适用请求体预算;两者均为固定值。"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:288
msgid ""
"A peer's AID changes only through a rotation of its identity, which this "
"hub follows through the pinned key history. If a peer's operator replaces"
" the hub's data directory and creates a new identity, remove the old "
"entry and add the new AID."
msgstr ""
"对等方的 AID 只会因其身份的轮换而改变,本 hub 通过已固定的密钥历史跟随这种变化。如果对等方的运营方替换了 hub "
"的数据目录并创建了新身份,请删除旧条目并添加新的 AID。"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:292
msgid "Clocks of federated hubs should agree to within a few minutes."
msgstr "联邦各 hub 的时钟应在数分钟以内保持一致。"

#: ../../ops/federation.rst:293
msgid ""
"Remove a peer by deleting its entry and restarting the hub. Pending "
"obligations remain in ``anet-hub due``."
msgstr "要移除对等方,删除其条目并重启 hub。未清偿的债务仍保留在 ``anet-hub due`` 中。"

